WEBVTT

00:08:57.792 --> 00:09:00.976
individual congresspeople
don't get to vote.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.768
It's done by states.

00:09:02.792 --> 00:09:04.684
Now, get your head wrapped around this.

00:09:04.708 --> 00:09:08.518
In 2020, the majority of Americans
live in blue states,

00:09:08.542 --> 00:09:11.059
but there are more red states.

00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:13.684
So there's a possibility

00:09:13.708 --> 00:09:16.643
that the Republicans
in the House of Representatives

00:09:16.667 --> 00:09:21.268
could just anoint
their candidate to be president,

00:09:21.292 --> 00:09:23.476
even without the popular vote,

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.809
or a majority in electoral college.

00:09:25.833 --> 00:09:27.351
That could happen.

00:09:27.375 --> 00:09:29.559
Now some people would call that outcome

00:09:29.583 --> 00:09:31.851
a perfectly legal,